# The build context is the repository root. docker/Dockerfile's build stage copies the sources
# (COPY . .), so this is an allowlist: everything is left out, then the sources are let back in.
# Kept out: .cache/ (over 1 GB of fetched sources), out/, web/node_modules/, web/dist/ (the
# build stage makes its own) and .git/.
*
!CMakeLists.txt
!Makefile
!cmake/
!src/
!test/
!vendor/
!web/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
